---
name: "Fix Plan Review"
description: "Fixes the problems reported by the plan self-review"
tags: [plan, review]
stage: plan
---
`openspec/changes/issue-${{ issue.number }}/self-review.md` lists the problems found by the plan
review. Dispose of every must-fix finding in the plan artifacts under
`openspec/changes/issue-${{ issue.number }}/`: fix it, or explain why it does not meet the
must-fix bar (leaving it unfixed would not make the plan wrong or incomplete
relative to the issue's goals or acceptance criteria). Observations do not
require action.

State each finding's disposition — fixed, or won't-fix with the reason — in your
final response; the next self-review verifies them one by one.

You may be interrupted at any time: commit incrementally and keep your progress
notes current.

Do not edit `self-review.md` — the next self-review task regenerates it.
